 "case:hints.h_accuse.levels.2": "The killer is Eddie Cole: he waited at the top of the steps and pushed Rhys backwards, to save the sale of the songs. Prove it with your answer about the two phone calls, your answer about the phone by the body, and your answer about Monday.",
 "case:hints.h_accuse_ready.levels.0": "For each proof slot, ask: which card shows the killer was free when Rhys fell, which puts the killer at the steps, and which shows what Monday would have cost him?",
 "case:hints.h_accuse_ready.levels.1": "The chance: your answer about the two phone calls, or the timeline. At the steps: your answer about the phone or the landing light, the 999 recording, Dana’s email, Bryn’s account, or the brass corners. The motive: your answer about Monday, the sale agreement, Carys on Eddie’s loan, or Rhys’s Thursday interview.",
