 "case:locations.farmhouse.description": "Huw’s family farmhouse, where the rest of the party slept: a flagged kitchen with an Aga, a creaking staircase, and small bedrooms under the eaves. Carys is staying on here this week, to be near where Rhys died.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_aga.label": "The Aga",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_aga.text": "The cream Aga hums in the corner, warm as a cow.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_carys.label": "Carys’s room",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_carys.text": "The spare room: an unmade bed, a suitcase, a box of sleeping tablets, and a document folder on the chair.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_room.label": "Dean and Bryn’s room",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_room.text": "Two single beds under the eaves. A plastic bucket by one of them, scrubbed out. On the windowsill, a bronze coin with ‘XII’ on it: twelve years sober. From this window you can’t see the granary at all.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_table.label": "The kitchen table",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_table.text": "A long pine table, still with eight chairs round it from Saturday’s dinner. Huw says nobody talked. Rhys ate in ten minutes and went back to the studio; Carys didn’t eat at all.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_window.label": "The landing window",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.hotspots.hs_fh_window.text": "From the little window on the farmhouse stairs you can just see the granary steps across the yard. At night, with no light on the landing, you would see nothing at all.",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.name": "The Farmhouse",
 "case:locations.farmhouse.summary": "Where Dean, Bryn and Carys slept.",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.0.label": "Window — the street",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.1.label": "Photo wall",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.2.label": "Guitars",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.3.label": "Kitchen table",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.4.label": "Shelf",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.5.label": "Mattress",
 "case:locations.flat.art.props.6.label": "Door",
 "case:locations.flat.description": "Two rooms over a guitar shop in Newport, where Dean teaches. There are guitars on every wall, a mattress, a kettle and a view of the bus station. Dean, on bail, isn’t allowed back to Hafod. Ffion has spread the defence papers across the kitchen table.",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_guitar.label": "The old guitar",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_guitar.text": "A battered sunburst guitar on its own hook, still strung with only five strings. ‘That’s the one,’ Ffion says. ‘He won’t let anyone touch it.’",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_laptop.label": "Ffion’s laptop",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_laptop.text": "After what Bryn saw, Ffion asked Dean’s solicitor for the ambulance service’s recording of the 999 call from Rhys’s watch. The line stayed open after the fall. It has just come through, with a transcript.",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_papers.label": "The defence papers",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_papers.text": "Ffion’s neat piles: the police disclosure, Dean’s interview, the bail conditions, and the pathologist’s report.",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_tape.label": "The cassette",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_tape.text": "A shoebox of old cassettes on the shelf. Ffion goes straight to one.",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_wall.label": "The photo wall",
 "case:locations.flat.hotspots.hs_df_wall.text": "Halflight in 1996, all elbows and cheekbones: on a roof in Pill, on a bus, at the top of a chart. Eddie is in every other photo with an arm round two of them. In one, Dean and Rhys sit on a kitchen table sharing a cigarette, one guitar between them.",
 "case:locations.flat.name": "Dean’s Flat",
 "case:locations.flat.summary": "Two rooms over a guitar shop in Newport, and the defence papers.",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.0.label": "Freya’s room",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.1.label": "Eddie’s room",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.2.label": "Rhys’s room",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.6.label": "Landing",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.7.label": "Light",
 "case:locations.granary.art.props.8.label": "Top of the steps",
 "case:locations.granary.description": "At the top of the fourteen steps is a flagged landing, a caged light on the wall above it, and three doors: Freya’s, nearest the steps; then Eddie’s; then Rhys’s, at the end. The rooms were once the granary loft, with low beams, sheepskins and a view of the hills. Huw has left Rhys’s room as the police left it.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_bulb.label": "The light fitting",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_bulb.text": "Huw fetches a screwdriver and takes the cage off the landing light.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_eddie.label": "Eddie’s door",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_eddie.text": "Locked. Eddie has moved to a hotel in Builth Wells for the week — ‘I can’t sleep up there’ — and Huw says the police have already been through the room.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_freya.label": "Freya’s room",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_freya.text": "Freya’s room, nearest the steps: camera bags, a drone case, a shoebox of hard drives, a sleeping bag on top of the duvet.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_landing.label": "The landing",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_landing.text": "Two people could just about pass each other up here. Three doors open onto it, and above them is a caged light on a sensor.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_rhys.label": "Rhys’s room",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_rhys.text": "Huw unlocks the end door for you.",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_view.label": "The top step",
 "case:locations.granary.hotspots.hs_gr_view.text": "From the top step you look straight down fourteen steps to the cobbles, and across the yard into the lounge window. The landing is so narrow that anyone waiting up here in the dark would be within arm’s reach of whoever came up.",
 "case:locations.granary.name": "The Granary",
 "case:locations.granary.summary": "The rooms over the old granary, where Rhys, Eddie and Freya slept.",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.0.label": "Window — the yard",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.1.label": "Sofa",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.2.label": "Sofa",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.3.label": "Table",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.4.label": "Wood burner",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.5.label": "Kitchenette",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.6.label": "Window to the control room",
 "case:locations.lounge.art.props.7.label": "Door",
 "case:locations.lounge.description": "The lounge at the end of the studio has two sofas, a kitchenette, a wood burner, a table of empty mugs, and the big window onto the yard. This is where everyone waited between takes. Huw hasn’t cleaned it since Sunday: the police told him not to touch anything, then never came back.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_burner.label": "The wood burner",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_burner.text": "A small cast-iron stove, cold now, with a basket of logs beside it. Nobody has touched the lounge since Sunday.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_corner.label": "The end of the sofa",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_corner.text": "Freya’s corner: a phone charger, a lens cloth, a mug with lipstick on it. From here you can see straight through the side window into the control room, to the back of Huw’s chair.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_ipad.label": "The band iPad",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_ipad.text": "The band’s shared iPad, propped against the fruit bowl: lyrics, set lists and the band’s group chat. Huw unlocks it for you.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_notepad.label": "Huw’s notepad",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_notepad.text": "Under the biscuit tin on the table is Huw’s studio notepad. You slide it out and tilt it to the window.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_stove.label": "The stove’s ash pan",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_stove.text": "Now that you know who lit the stove on Sunday, you open the ash pan.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_table.label": "The table",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_table.text": "Mugs, a biscuit tin, and a tour plan, ‘HALFLIGHT 2025 — 24 DATES’, with a heart drawn round ‘Small Hours — encore’.",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_window.label": "The window",
 "case:locations.lounge.hotspots.hs_lg_window.text": "From the end of the sofa you look straight across the yard at the granary steps. At night, with the lamps on in here, the yard would be a black mirror — but you couldn’t miss the landing light coming on.",
 "case:locations.lounge.name": "The Lounge",
 "case:locations.lounge.summary": "The studio lounge: sofas, a stove, and a window onto the yard.",
 "case:locations.studio.art.props.0.label": "Live room",
