 "case:locations.studio.art.props.6.label": "Computer",
 "case:locations.studio.art.props.7.label": "Whiteboard",
 "case:locations.studio.art.props.8.label": "Sofa",
 "case:locations.studio.art.props.9.label": "Window to the lounge",
 "case:locations.studio.description": "The old barn has a live room big enough for an orchestra, rugs and drums and amps under the beams. Behind the glass is the control room, where Huw’s desk takes up a whole wall. A leather sofa sits at the back, and a side window looks into the lounge next door. Everything is as it was on Saturday night: the police never came in here.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_booth.label": "The vocal booth",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_booth.text": "A booth in the corner of the live room: one microphone, a pop shield, and a music stand with a lyric sheet still on it.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_clock.label": "The wall clock",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_clock.text": "A big station clock over the glass. It shows the right time now. ‘Put it back on Sunday afternoon,’ Huw says. ‘First thing I’d done by hand all week.’",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_computer.label": "The studio computer",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_computer.text": "Huw wakes the computer and opens Saturday’s session.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_drawer.label": "Huw’s desk drawer",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_drawer.text": "Cables, spare valves, a tin of toffees, and a sheaf of letters Huw would rather not open.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_glass.label": "The window to the lounge",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_glass.text": "A side window looks from the control room into the lounge next door. From the desk you can see the lounge sofa and the stove; from the lounge sofa, the desk.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_sofa.label": "The sofa",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_sofa.text": "A battered leather sofa at the back of the control room, with a view of the desk and, through the glass, the live room. On Saturday night Eddie sat here with his laptop on his knees and his headphones on, on his call.",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_whiteboard.label": "The whiteboard",
 "case:locations.studio.hotspots.hs_st_whiteboard.text": "A whiteboard by the control-room door, covered in Huw’s capitals.",
 "case:locations.studio.name": "The Studio",
 "case:locations.studio.summary": "The live room and Huw’s control room, in the old barn.",
 "case:locations.yard.art.props.0.label": "The studio (old barn)",
 "case:locations.yard.art.props.1.label": "Studio door",
 "case:locations.yard.art.props.2.label": "Lounge window",
 "case:locations.yard.art.props.3.label": "Cobbles",
 "case:locations.yard.art.props.4.label": "Farmhouse",
